Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,voices We take in the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah Here we are\Nin between the sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky Ready now for adventure We're itching\Nto try Get ready to roam So all aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,now we're set to go Set sail to the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so deep Ready for a truly grand adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think that sounds really\Nfun All this excitement is second to none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that I just won't ever\Nforget It's the way that I felt when our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,journey was set Now I won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou now, fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want already oh yeah\Ni'm here because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,crap you pulled earlier\Nwhen you took my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With that lamp, I'm taking it back\Nalong with Serious Sanji and Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh and the old zombie guys too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.62,0:03:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah you're greedy one aren't you and\Nhow do you plan on achieving all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously by kicking your ass. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you're gonna kick\Nmy ass. Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well even if you do manage to beat me\Nor Even kill me it won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The zombies will lose their master\Nbut the shadows won't Return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah that's right my power\Ncontrols the shadows that's absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So fair warning if you\Nwant the shadows back then
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only one solution you\Nhave to get the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows and other words\Nneed to issue them an order
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,because they aren't going\Nanywhere unless i Say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all it's gonna\Ntake to get them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it pretty simple huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.62,0:04:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You might even Be able to force me to\Nreturn them if you kick my ass hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well i say that but with your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.22,0:04:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt you can even lay a finger on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go through him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider him my double.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I call him the Doppelman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, I was just like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,overconfident in my abilities\Nand full of unrealistic ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I realized the key to victory\Nis having underlings, real strong ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:05:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck, Doppelguy! Come on! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never do anything on my own again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Without lifting a finger, my minions\Nwill make me the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of the pirates is going to be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to recall your zombie\Nmaking the same claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When there's such an extreme difference\Nbetween the body and the shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,then the personality of the shadow's\Noriginal owner lingers a bit more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But that sort of thing can't\Nlast forever, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before\Nall your memories will fade,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and Oz becomes an obedient zombie\Nslave just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong its will may be, every\Nzombie will bounce me sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind being patient for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.48,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get my shadow back first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:05:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Brickbat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, these things keep blocking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to punch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't actually drink blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you defeating me? Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rookie pirate, so cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools are just setting yourselves\Nup for your own humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've really pissed me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Gunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:06:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to escape? What a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tip-shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ass just got kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that a Nami I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The night has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is a goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, man. That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise It's just she was so\Nbeautiful I mean, princesses are nice and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he mumbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This moron is out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're a member of that\Npirate crew, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's just my bride. My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel you on that one, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's like the only things that\Nlook good in white or Nami and rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen, brother
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You might say one look at her will\Nstop you white in your tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.38,0:08:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough chitchat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you try to get friendly with me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You almost hit Nami with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacking me is one thing, but show some\Ndamn courtesy when there's a lady around!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, your\Nshadow—it's gone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.32,0:09:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the new zombies we created\Nwas strangely attached to my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the will of his shadow hadn't\Nfaded, so he wasn't obedient to us just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't lay a hand on this lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been your zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't even bother\Nputting your shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,in a zombie general and\Nsince that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming your fighting\Nskills are pretty weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.84,0:09:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you are overdressed, weaklings\Nthat run your mouth too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am one of the mysterious three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the zombie generals\Nare under my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you\Nstand a chance against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:09:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it's Nami again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really messing me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you know what—I'll be generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you drag your sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadowless carcass out of here right now\Nand never come back. I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I'm really busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stupid captain, stupid zombie,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,went on a rampage and smashed\Nup some of my best men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But before I deal with that, I'm\Nkissing my damn bride—and that's final!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running very low on patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't waste my time fighting\Nwith something like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, I talked too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You, creeper master Anselm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.24,0:10:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No way—he weighs more than 600 pounds\Nand he got knocked back just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the big bad\Ninvisible man Usopp was talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,man Usopp was talking
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What was with that kick?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkback made my body\Ninto the perfect animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No human should
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,be able to do that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands of the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he know what I was going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the guy that showed up on the sunny
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and dragged your filthy\Ntongue all over Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is grabbing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And I heard you were peeping on Nami\Nwhile she was naked in the bath, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hush, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,El Drone! Plaché! Halcini!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is just a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.00,0:11:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Jode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is Nami unconscious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not have done\Nanything weird to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You call this crap a wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that to my face again and I'll\Npound you into a croquette, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd better pull back for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisiscuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for Usopp's salt balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? You say\Nyou're running low on patience?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I'm way beyond that buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so pissed off I'm about to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And this isn't just about\NNami either. Oh, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there's an issue a\Nlittle something between
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.36,0:12:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the two of us that goes back a long way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked him flat, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there's an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.82,0:13:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, you're a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole Nami and you stole my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.16,0:13:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got me confused with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never even met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Before but if you want\Nto pick a fight with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.72,0:13:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll start with my hands of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I 'LL BLOW YOU AWAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The guns. Take them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off those bazookas you've\Ngot strapped to your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll only say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If Nami gets injured in your crossfire,\Nby the time I'm done with you,?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:14:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be twice as dead\Nas those zombies of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he have known?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried asking you nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take those damn things off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? Bazookas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did those even come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured it was something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy with your powers only got\Nso many tricks up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can turn invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know you can turn\Nanything you touch invisible to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's the extent of your powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Against me, your tactics are as
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,transparent as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.32,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know everything\Nabout the clear clear fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy, do you think he and Absalom\Nhave got some kind of history?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only thing\Nthat makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I scoured the Devil Fruit\Nencyclopedia when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even believe half\Nof it and most of the fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,abilities didn't sound like they\Nwere worth the curse anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,except for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one fruit that spoke to my\Nvery soul, and I made the decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,if I ever had the luck\Nof finding that fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,then I would embrace the curse and\Nswallow it whole no matter what the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, there's only\None of each Devil Fruit in the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I knew that if I ever met the\Npower holder with that ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,my dream would be vanquished.\Nsee what you've done, the only
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,thing I wanted was to experience\Ninvisibility for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But you just had to go and find the\Nclear clear fruit first you took
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,its powers and you stole my dream\Nalong with it that's why he's mad
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,my dream I saw it so clearly I\Ncould do so much good with it use it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to protect new girls no I mean I\Ncould help all mankind and new girls
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I had this beautiful vision of\Nthe future and no girls. He just
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,wants to peek at naked girls he's\Na complete pervert shut up after a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,lifetime of fantasizing about that\Nfruit I know how much you can peep
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,no wait I mean I know how much you\Ncan help humanity with it understand
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.50,0:16:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,not only did you kidnap\Nnami and endanger her life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've squandered\Nall the good I could have
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Done for this world. No girls.\NNo I meant wrath. Prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to suffer my wrath so\Nthat's the issue here you're
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,mad I ate the clear clear\Nfruit before you could
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,find it you know that's\Nthe most petty damn thing I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,ever heard that's the word\Npetty you are a jealous
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.76,0:16:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pervert! You have no right.\NYou can't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes one to know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.14,0:16:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.97,0:16:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The exact same!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.48,0:16:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done listening to this nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're taking out your anger on the wrong\Nguy, and now I'm gonna give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't just have the jaw of\Na lion. I got elephant skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.56,0:17:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and 600 pounds of muscle\Nfrom bears and gorillas Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkback built this body\Nfrom the most Savage beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you could imagine it's a\Nsavage patchwork quilt of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,ferocity a Masterpiece the\Nclear clear fruit you crave
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So much it's just a bonus.\NYet I've got another weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,just a tool to enhance\Nmy strength. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You still paint!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.78,0:17:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a pretty good point there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No mere human could keep\Nkicking me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My body would shatter\Nthe bones in his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But he keeps on attacking me\Nlike I'm a bag of feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, the last laugh will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted this Devil Fruit power of mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and you want to steal\Nmy future bride from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But face the facts, they're both mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The next thing I'm taking\Nfrom you is your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,once he grabbed Nami, she disappeared too,\Nand we weren't able to chase after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're coming after Nami, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not getting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you even looking for I'm invisible\Nmoron but you can still feel my power
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh really you think you can\Nsave her by sacrificing yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that's fine with me\Nlet's see how it works out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, mystery manhandler!\NMissing land kick her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Put her down gently now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You dropped her? Guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't care so much\Nabout her after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to ruin your\Nwhite dress with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn coward using his\Ncheap powers to hide from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At least now I know the\Nreality behind my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.78,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I didn't find that\Ndamn Devil Fruit after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can peep fine the way I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna peep after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.62,0:20:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you now, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the different animals\Nyou've got stitched into you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you're gonna make one\Ndamn tasty casserole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I said let go of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.76,0:20:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nude girls, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I now pronounce you man in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't stop chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could just figure\Nout how to finish him off,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I could get rid of all the other pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that long-nosed jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't stop chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.96,0:21:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could just figure\Nout how to finish him off,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I could get rid of that snotty ghost girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that zombie bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit chasing me and quit\Nrunning, ghost girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and take care\Nof him already, Koobasie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't rock him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.04,0:21:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit harassing my mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scaring her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of sick monster would\Nmake such a violent teddy bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:21:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like the\Nother zombies after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.94,0:22:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's add a dash of\Noil for a little entree
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.46,0:22:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I like to call don't\Ncross this line technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and get me now, you stupid bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.80,0:22:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm total genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that you're out of the equation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,your precious mistress kooky\Nlaughter ghost girl is going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.44,0:22:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then it's time to\Nteach that ghost girl a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.76,0:22:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep a lesson in complete and total defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the she was right here\Nlooking for me right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.94,0:22:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of trick where is she\Ndid she go outside no that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.80,0:22:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This tower's so high\Nthat she'd have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.66,0:23:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the hell are\Nyou floating like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.20,0:23:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought your power was to control\Nghosts Okay, before we go any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I should ask, what is your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.20,0:23:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my little secret. No\None messes with the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.88,0:23:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, I\Nknow how to beat you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I'm through with\Nyou, your friends are next.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't have a chance in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And everything was going so good!
